<glyph name="R" format="2">
  <advance width="696"/>
  <unicode hex="0052"/>
  <note>
A pear-shaped bowl flows into a curved, outward-running leg instead of an attached slash.
Weight master: 正文中粗：竖茎 108、横画 94，比 Regular 暗一档，但横画追得更快，对比下降。B 上碗开始收、下碗保持，腰轻收。M 谷加深而不是简单加粗。字距略紧。
</note>
